WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:02.580
Where do you start with AI?

2
00:00:02.780 --> 00:00:05.514
With the problem, not the
technology.

3
00:00:05.514 --> 00:00:07.735
At Total Success AI, my partner

4
00:00:07.735 --> 00:00:11.409
Manny Torres and I begin with an
AI Impact Analysis.

5
00:00:11.409 --> 00:00:13.374
We look at how your business

6
00:00:13.374 --> 00:00:15.766
really works and show you where AI

7
00:00:15.766 --> 00:00:18.756
can save time, cut costs
and grow revenue.

8
00:00:18.756 --> 00:00:21.063
Then we help you choose the right

9
00:00:21.063 --> 00:00:23.028
tools for your goals, and we

10
00:00:23.028 --> 00:00:27.214
either set them up for you or
guide you every step of the way.

11
00:00:27.214 --> 00:00:29.863
AI isn't here to replace
your people.

12
00:00:29.863 --> 00:00:33.280
It's here to free them to do what
only humans can.
